OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 6 FEB
OL,4,G2300FThe Rock Show with Shaun Keaveny
OL,5,     GJames Maynard Keenan, enigmatic
OL,6,     Gfrontman for Tool, A Perfect
OL,7,     GCircle and his current project
OL,8,     GPucifer, chooses his own Rock God.
OL,9,G0000FRomesh Ranganathan: For the Love
OL,10,     Fof Hip Hop
OL,11,     GRomesh Ranganathan shares his
OL,12,     Glife-long love of hip hop.
OL,13,G0100FTony Blackburn's Sounds of Soul
OL,14,     GIt's 'Good Times' as Tony spins
OL,15,     Ggreat uplifting Soul music.
OL,16,     GIncluding brilliant tracks from
OL,17,     GCandi Staton, Chic, Natasha Watt,
OL,18,     GDonald Byrd and more. Plus new
OL,19,     Gmusic From Jill Scott.
